WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:04.760
We're losing people because of the fear of
this building.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.490
There is something in that basement.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.420
It's affected my family, my relationship,
my career.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.520
These things are real.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.640
Who believes this place is haunted?

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:25.690
Are you human?

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:28.190
I hear gay people.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.720
Remember in high school I didn't know which
one I was more afraid of, telling people I

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.420
was gay or telling them I saw ghosts.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.930
Velvet! There's a woman in a mansion with
problems.

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:42.930
We're not supposed to feel alone.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:48.510
You need to know these things are not
permanent.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.360
I very strongly connect with those that have departed.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:57.000
I am the resident, which depending on how the
shells fall, that's how I interpret what the

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:57.870
message is.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.200
I think we should use the SLS.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.880
Oh my God.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.500
Okay, there's someone sitting in the chair.

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:08.640
Based on these cards, I do believe you're in
danger, girl.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:15.240
Now, when a Latina has this much eyeliner on,
she means business.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:15.750
What'd you just say?

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:19.490
What'd you just say? Tell me.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:21.380
It's actually a demonic entity.

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:24.690
What are we going to do?

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.340
Somebody with a flashlight go ahead of me.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:33.800
He ain't gonna let you rain on my parade no
more.

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:38.930
The demons we sometimes deal with that are
the hardest are those we find within ourselves.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:41.870
I'm so proud of you and I see you.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:47.810
If me dealing with the world keeps me from
dealing with me on my worst day, I'm okay

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:48.410
with that.

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:50.390
I won't leave with that being the truth.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.910
It's time to let go of this.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:57.590
I just want you to know you made it through
it and you came out stronger.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.630
I want to empower the good spirits.

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:06.230
Who's ready to get freaky?

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:09.260
Take our hands as we criss-cross America through the unknown

00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:10.280
and beyond.

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:13.400
We're living for the dead.

